The fix introduces a check to confirm whether the cluster was added successfully and implements a retry mechanism to handle cases where the Helix cluster is not fully set up. This ensures that the system waits and retries adding instances, preventing premature failures that lead to the AMS stopping after a Rolling Upgrade.

